    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d282">

                <pb facs="0439" n="351" xml:id="pg351"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">King Humbert to the
                            President</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Monza Royal Castle</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-07-23"><hi rendition="#italic">July 23,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Benjamin Harrison</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">President of the United States,<lb/>Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>In the solemnization at New York of glorious remembrances my will was that by its
                    participation my Government might attest the sound friendship which binds Italy
                    to the great people of the United States. I thank you for having so nobly
                    received this, my sentiment.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Humbert.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
